{{>head}}
<body class="bg-gray-50">
  {{>nav}}

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 cf-fade-up">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Home</a>
      <i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
      <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium">Terms and Conditions</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-card p-8 md:p-10 cf-fade-up">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="cf-badge cf-badge-green mb-3">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-800 mb-1">Terms and Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: November 25, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>By accessing and using CultureFrame, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms of this agreement. If you do not agree, please do not use our service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            Use of Service
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">CultureFrame is dedicated to promoting and preserving the cultural heritage of Oriental Mindoro. You agree to use this service only for lawful purposes.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> You must be at least 13 years old to use this service</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> You agree not to misuse or abuse the platform</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> You will not post inappropriate or offensive content</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            User Accounts
          </h2>
          <p>When you create an account, you must provide accurate and complete information. You are responsible for safeguarding your password and all activities that occur under your account.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            Content
          </h2>
          <p>Our service allows you to post, share, and store information. You are responsible for the content that you post on or through the service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            E-Commerce
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When purchasing products through our shop:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> All prices are in Philippine Pesos (₱)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> Payment must be completed before order processing</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> Shipping fees may apply based on location</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> Orders are subject to product availability</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">6</span>
            Event Registration
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When registering for events:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> Registration is subject to availability</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> You must provide accurate contact information</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i> Event details may change — registered participants will be notified</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">7</span>
            Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p>The service and its original content are owned by CultureFrame and are protected by international copyright and intellectual property laws.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">8</span>
            Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>Your privacy is important to us. We collect and use your personal information in accordance with our Privacy Policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">9</span>
            Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p>CultureFrame shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your use of or inability to use the service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">10</span>
            Changes to Terms
          </h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">11</span>
            Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p>If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us through our platform or visit us in Mansalay, Oriental Mindoro, Philippines.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/register" class="cf-btn cf-btn-primary text-sm">
          <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> Register
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="cf-btn cf-btn-ghost text-sm">
          <i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {{>footer}}
</body>
</html>
